OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJudge blocks Trump closure of 'Trash
OL,4,AIsland' Washington DC golf course on
OL,5,ASunday
OL,6,
OL,7,FReyes has said President Donald Trump
OL,8,Fcannot close the park nor its golf
OL,9,Fcourse, but added that his
OL,10,Fadministration was not required to
OL,11,Factively manage either.
OL,13,FTrump, an avid golfer, has said his
OL,14,Fplans to upgrade the 106-year-old
OL,15,Fcourse will create "one of the Best and
OL,16,FMost Spectacular Golf Courses anywhere
OL,17,Fin the World". The BBC has contacted
OL,18,Fthe White House for comment.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
